Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: the Kconfig of the audio techpack

The Z500KL's audio is in techpack/audio, from the kenzo's 4.9 (same SoC) with ASUS'
values: files/techpack/audio and files/arch/arm64/boot/dts/asus/z500kl-audio.dtsi.
Generic ALSA, regmap, SPMI and IOMMU code is not changed, only this include.
---
--- sound/soc/Kconfig
+++ sound/soc/Kconfig
@@ -81,3 +81,5 @@
 
 endif	# SND_SOC
 
+
+source "techpack/audio/Kconfig"
